00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:27.280
then trying to run, and trying to run and
keep pace with the market.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.100
That's-
&gt;&gt; That's the journey.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.820
So in the parts of the world where
Standard Chartered has a big

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.610
footprint-
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.610
&gt;&gt; Asia, Southeast Asia,
Africa, a lot of volatility.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.180
And in particular, if you look at
