00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.420
a major crisis in at least one of our
70 or 80 markets where we operate.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.327
And in many cases,
I think of the Asian financial crisis or

00:03:59.327 --> 00:04:04.694
obviously the great financial crisis,
A crisis has been in all those markets.

00:04:04.694 --> 00:04:09.679
So, we have a tag line which is at
