00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.260
And it also means that we come and stay.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.810
And so, we've left very few
places in those 160 years.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:27.125
And we left Iran, we left Afghanistan,
